Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 14:24:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/32] WIP: MT6750 k50v1 tablet stage-0 bring-up (dts with lk
 overlay sink, ramcon, wdt pwrkey bypass)

---
